{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"eucalyptic-petit-bittern","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\nThe hourly host updater `/Users/joeoakhart/.local/bin/rebar-dev-update.sh` requests `nava-rebar[mcp,reviewbot,ui,agents,eval,tracing,grounding,grounding-t2,dev]`. Current `pyproject.toml` explicitly declares `[dev]` and `[eval]` incompatible because dev includes the Bedrock provider (`boto3>=1.42.63`) while Inspect AI pins aiobotocore to `boto3<1.40.62`. The 2026-08-04 01:27 launchd run failed with uv's unsatisfiable-resolution proof and left `last-good.sha` at `d72c4777`. This blocks the explicit host-runtime refresh required by epic 0303 A2-2 and later A6-1.\n\n## Approach\n- Remove only the development-only `dev` extra from the machine-local updater specification; retain the runtime/operator extras, including `agents`, `eval`, `reviewbot`, `mcp`, tracing, UI, and grounding.\n- Trigger the updater through launchd so the real minimal-environment path performs an install from the exact current `origin/main` SHA.\n- Verify the installed executable and distribution, recorded source SHA, smoke tests, global criteria loading, and the immediately following idempotent no-op.\n- Preserve the rollback guard and do not mutate repository files.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] [code-verifiable] The updater specification does not request the declared-incompatible `dev`+`eval` pair and still requests every runtime/operator extra it previously supplied. Tier: deterministic script-content check.\n- [ ] [operator-attested] A launchd-triggered real install exits 0 and advances `last-good.sha` to the exact `origin/main` SHA used for the run.\n- [ ] [operator-attested] `/Users/joeoakhart/.local/bin/rebar` resolves to the pipx `nava-rebar` environment, its installed distribution is 0.10.1, and both updater smoke commands exit 0.\n- [ ] [operator-attested] The freshly installed global build loads this repository's effective criteria without a configuration error.\n- [ ] [operator-attested] An immediately following launchd run takes the no-change path and exits 0.\n- [ ] [code-verifiable] The updater's last-good rollback guard and exact-SHA install behavior remain unchanged. Tier: deterministic script diff.\n\n## Files\nMachine-local `/Users/joeoakhart/.local/bin/rebar-dev-update.sh`; no repository files.\n\nScope: XS. Discovered while collecting A2-2 rollout evidence.","id":"4ba4-8086-8665-4303","parent_id":"","priority":1,"tags":["host-updater","pipx","rollout"],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"Host rebar updater requests incompatible dev and eval extras"},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1785807775929050001,"uuid":"570b69d8-3b38-4173-ba85-44ddd03ade4d"}